{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46758","headline":"题南岳般若寺 · 齐己","name":"题南岳般若寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诸峯翠少中峯翠，五寺名高此寺名。\n石路险盘岚霭滑，僧窗高倚泬寥明。\n凌空殿阁由天设，遍地杉松是自生。\n更有上方难上处，紫苔红藓遶峥嵘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46758.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46758","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}